        "original_id": "ed9c2905-57c8-5574-a973-27bc5b252197",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ekaterina Davydova, Roman Kostomarov, Tatiana Navka\n- Roles: ice dancers, champions\n- Events: World Junior Championships, Olympic Games, World Championships, Grand Prix Final, European Championships\n\nFacts:\n- Ekaterina Alexeyevna Davydova was born on 17 September 1978 and is a Russian former competitive ice dancer.\n- Ekaterina Davydova and Roman Kostomarov won the 1996 World Junior title.\n- Roman Kostomarov and Tatiana Navka won the World Championships in 2004 and 2005, the Grand Prix Final from 2003 to 2005, the European Championships from 2004 to 2006, and the 2006 Olympic title.",
